<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-035" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong:account" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong:account:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王安豐</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong:account:m0003" ref="c46_7o5_azx">婦</persName>，常卿<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong:account:m0007" ref="48e_04a_3d8">安豐</persName>。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong:account:m0010" ref="48e_04a_3d8">安豐</persName>曰：「婦人卿婿，於禮為不敬，後勿復爾。」<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-035-jin043-wangrong:account:m0032" ref="c46_7o5_azx">婦</persName>曰：「親卿愛卿，是以卿卿；我不卿卿，誰當卿卿？」遂恆聽之。</p>
</text>
